# Excludes these paths from renv's dependency scan (renv::dependencies(),
# used by renv::snapshot() when producing renv.lock). Same syntax as
# .gitignore. This is renv's own ignore-file convention -- a separate
# mechanism from rsconnect's .rscignore, though they exclude the same path
# for the same reason.

# forecastsuite/ is a separate, independently-versioned R package (its own
# DESCRIPTION-based dependency management) -- not part of this hosted Shiny
# app, and including it would pollute the lockfile with its dependency set.
forecastsuite/
